    "c_content_panel_JPzgYV": {
      "type": "c-content-panel",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_tVPDhz": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HEAT RETAINING: Superior Warmth from High Quality Down"
          }
        },
        "text_BTgxhB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The AURORA TEX Down Jacket is filled with 150g of high fill power down rated at 760FP, making it versatile enough to wear from outdoor settings to everyday life. Since the brand's launch, NANGA has used down from Kawada Feather, a down material manufacturer founded in 1891. Today, the jacket uses premium down from the Moulard breed sourced from Spanish farms under a partnership contract with Kawada Feather. Moulard down is known for its dense structure and large down clusters. Combined with world leading cleaning technology, the result is down that is lightweight, highly resilient, and resistant to flattening over time. This dedication to down is what creates the jacket's warmth.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_tVPDhz",
